@startuml
title v0.5.1 多用户知识专栏博客系统 - 用例图

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "游客" as Guest
actor "注册用户" as User
actor "管理员" as Admin
actor "AI 服务\n需配置 API Key 后验证" as AI

rectangle "personal-blog-system\n当前分支：process/unified-main-repo（工程治理分支）" {
  usecase "浏览首页/发现页/文章列表" as UC_Browse
  usecase "阅读已发布文章" as UC_Read
  usecase "按分类/标签/专栏/作者浏览" as UC_Discover
  usecase "传统关键词搜索" as UC_Search
  usecase "注册账号" as UC_Register
  usecase "登录/退出" as UC_Login

  usecase "维护个人资料/修改密码" as UC_Profile
  usecase "创建和管理自己的专栏" as UC_Column
  usecase "新建/保存草稿/发布文章" as UC_Write
  usecase "编辑/删除自己的文章" as UC_EditArticle
  usecase "提交评论（待审核）" as UC_Comment
  usecase "点赞/收藏文章" as UC_LikeFav

  usecase "后台仪表盘" as UC_Dashboard
  usecase "管理用户" as UC_AdminUser
  usecase "管理全站文章" as UC_AdminArticle
  usecase "管理分类/标签/专栏" as UC_AdminTaxonomy
  usecase "审核/隐藏/删除评论" as UC_Moderate
  usecase "查看 AI 配置状态" as UC_AIStatus

  usecase "AI 摘要/标签/润色/问答/大纲/标题" as UC_AIWriting
  usecase "AI 智能搜索\n意图理解/扩展/SQL 候选/重排/降级" as UC_AISearch
  usecase "记录 AI 基础日志" as UC_AILog
}

Guest --> UC_Browse
Guest --> UC_Read
Guest --> UC_Discover
Guest --> UC_Search
Guest --> UC_Register
Guest --> UC_Login
Guest --> UC_AISearch

User --|> Guest
User --> UC_Profile
User --> UC_Column
User --> UC_Write
User --> UC_EditArticle
User --> UC_Comment
User --> UC_LikeFav
User --> UC_AIWriting

Admin --|> User
Admin --> UC_Dashboard
Admin --> UC_AdminUser
Admin --> UC_AdminArticle
Admin --> UC_AdminTaxonomy
Admin --> UC_Moderate
Admin --> UC_AIStatus

UC_AIWriting ..> UC_AILog : 写入基础日志
UC_AISearch ..> UC_AILog : 写入基础日志
AI --> UC_AIWriting
AI --> UC_AISearch

note right of UC_AIWriting
  当前代码接口存在；
  真实远程调用需配置 API Key 后验证。
end note

note bottom
  ADR-002：选择方案 B，保留 Flask + Jinja2 + SQLAlchemy + SQLite 技术栈，
  在测试保护、需求确认和 ADR 约束下做受控局部重构。
  本图只表达当前实现和文档确认范围，不包含未来候选能力。
end note
@enduml
